# 🪔 Wedding Web App (Nepali Hindu Wedding)

Free static site on **GitHub Pages** + **Google Apps Script / Sheets / Drive** as the backend.
See [WEDDING_PLAN.md](WEDDING_PLAN.md) for the full plan and roadmap.

## What's included (phase 0–6 foundation)
- 🌐 Language switch: **English / नेपाली / नेपाली + English (mixed)**
- 📝 Guest registration (required details, per-event RSVP, meal, travel dates)
- 📊 Real-time attendance dashboard (auto-refresh every 15s)
- 🏨 Accommodation — only for guests the admin enables
- 🪪 Age verification + drinking bands (green / yellow / red / blue)
- 🏷️ Name tags with relation to bride/groom + printable wristbands
- 🎫 Personal guest pass with QR
- 🪔 Memorial for Mom: light a diya, share memories, moderation
- ⚙️ Admin settings: toggle every feature, theme colors, legal drinking age, language default
- 🎨 Auto theme by side: **Bride side = "Gulabi Marigold"** (rose pink + marigold), **Groom side = "Royal Peacock"** (peacock teal + gold)
- 📲 Installable app on **iOS and Android** (home screen icon, full-screen, bottom tab bar, works offline at the venue) with an **Install app** button
- ⏹️ Auto turns OFF after `wedding.endDate` (shows a thank-you screen; memorial can stay open)

## Setup (all free)

### 1. Google backend
1. Use a **personal Google account** (not a work account).
2. Create a new Google Sheet → **Extensions → Apps Script**.
3. Paste the contents of `apps-script/Code.gs` into `Code.gs`, save.
4. Select function **`setup`** → **Run** → authorize.
5. **Project Settings → Script Properties** → change `ADMIN_PASSCODE` to your own secret.
6. **Deploy → New deployment → Web app**
   - Execute as: **Me**
   - Who has access: **Anyone**
7. Copy the `/exec` URL.

> After editing `Code.gs`, use **Deploy → Manage deployments → Edit → New version** so the same URL keeps working.

### 2. Front end
1. Paste the `/exec` URL into `js/config.js` → `API_URL`.
2. Test locally (any static server), for example:
   ```powershell
   npx serve .
   ```
3. Open `admin/index.html`, log in with your passcode, add guests (or import CSV).

### 3. Publish on GitHub Pages
```powershell
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Wedding site"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://github.com/<you>/<repo>.git
git push -u origin main
```
GitHub → repo **Settings → Pages** → Source: `main` / root. Site URL: `https://<you>.github.io/<repo>/`.

> ⚠️ This folder is currently inside a work OneDrive. Consider moving it to a personal folder before publishing.

## Using it
| Who | Link |
|---|---|
| Guest | `https://<site>/index.html?g=GUESTID` (copy or WhatsApp from admin) |
| Registration | `register.html?g=GUESTID` |
| Guest pass | `pass.html?g=GUESTID` |
| Memorial | `memorial.html` |
| Admin | `admin/index.html` |
| Name tags / bands | `admin/nametags.html` |

### Events
Add rows to the **Events** sheet: `EventId, NameEn, NameNe, DateTime, Venue, MapLink, DressCode, RevealStyle, UnlockAt, Groups, Order, Visible`.
- `Groups`: `All` or comma list (e.g., `Family, Bride`).
- `UnlockAt`: event stays hidden (server-side) until this time.
- `Visible`: `TRUE` to show.

### Side themes
- Applied automatically from the guest's `Side` (set by admin or chosen at registration).
- Colors editable in Settings: `theme.bridePrimary/brideAccent`, `theme.groomPrimary/groomAccent`. Toggle: `feature.sideThemes`.

### Install as app
- **Android (Chrome):** tap **📲 Install app** → Install.
- **iOS (Safari):** tap **📲 Install app** → follow the on-screen steps (Share → Add to Home Screen). iOS has no one-tap install API.
- Opened inside WhatsApp/Instagram? The button tells guests to open the link in Safari/Chrome first.
- Guests should install **from their personal link** so the app remembers who they are.
- Requires HTTPS (GitHub Pages provides it). Icons are in `icons/`.

### Auto turn-off
- After `wedding.endDate` the server rejects guest requests and pages show a thank-you screen.
- `app.keepMemorialAfterEnd = TRUE` keeps Mom's memorial page open. Admin pages keep working.

### Drinking bands
- Age is calculated from DOB. Legal age = setting `drink.legalAge`.
- 🟡 Yellow until a volunteer ticks **ID verified** in Admin → Guests → becomes 🟢 Green.
- 🔴 Red: under age · 🔵 Blue: guest chose "I don't drink".

